    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Videonauts is a story-focused adventure puzzle game about escaping a spooky and dangerous mansion... and discovering the secret behind a bizarre video collection within. The game features <strong>multiple endings</strong>, mysterious <strong>puzzles</strong> where you search your environment, and hand-drawn limited-palette <strong>pixel art</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices you make matter... certain character traits will be remembered as you have conversations with others, which means even innocuous exchanges may change everyone's fate!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Coby is invited to a mansion to gander at a large collection of ancient artifacts, along with a small handful of other curious critters. But it soon becomes obvious this is a mansion of many deadly tricks and secrets of unexplained origin. What will happen to everyone as they try to escape? It doesn't look like everyone will make it out alive...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Among the collector's ancient artifacts, there seems to be a strange choice... video tapes! The tour guide insists they should never be touched, but why? Our protagonist Coby would rather not find out the secret of these videos, but it looks like he won't have a choice...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678420/extras/f16c0203aff16ad5afb48f8091ff3027.avif?t=1755716479\" width=496 height=76 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid taking damage from the strange surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moody music and atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles with many twists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro tile-based movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A special limited-colour lighting effect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute animal characters with cartoony expressions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve deeper and discover...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...there's more to the mansion than meets the eye!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Videonauts is a story-focused adventure puzzle game about escaping a spooky and dangerous mansion... and discovering the secret behind a bizarre video collection within. The game features <strong>multiple endings</strong>, mysterious <strong>puzzles</strong> where you search your environment, and hand-drawn limited-palette <strong>pixel art</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices you make matter... certain character traits will be remembered as you have conversations with others, which means even innocuous exchanges may change everyone's fate!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Coby is invited to a mansion to gander at a large collection of ancient artifacts, along with a small handful of other curious critters. But it soon becomes obvious this is a mansion of many deadly tricks and secrets of unexplained origin. What will happen to everyone as they try to escape? It doesn't look like everyone will make it out alive...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Among the collector's ancient artifacts, there seems to be a strange choice... video tapes! The tour guide insists they should never be touched, but why? Our protagonist Coby would rather not find out the secret of these videos, but it looks like he won't have a choice...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678420/extras/f16c0203aff16ad5afb48f8091ff3027.avif?t=1755716479\" width=496 height=76 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid taking damage from the strange surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moody music and atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles with many twists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro tile-based movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A special limited-colour lighting effect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute animal characters with cartoony expressions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve deeper and discover...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...there's more to the mansion than meets the eye!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
